    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Enjeunoto kitok",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore enkaraki ina keishiaakino nikirrip nena nikitoning'o oleng, pee mikipaashare ake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu amaa te na keewuo olkilikuai apa otolimutuo ilmalaika neaku ore engilata enye aashu eanyata netum enkitamioto, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kaji kijeunye iyiook ti nikintololoiki enjeunoto kitok naba inji? Olaitoriani otang'asa alimu te dukuya, neetuo aaishakenoki ti alo iyiook lelo apa ootoning'o ninye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neishakenoko sii ninye Enkai too lmonek o too mbaa e nking'asia o too mpukunot kumok e nking'asia o too nkishorunot e Nkiyang'et Sinyati naori te risioroto e yieuna enye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.2.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ilo laa ninye orrikoki iyiook enjeunoto.",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu mme lmalaika eishoo Enkai meitoria enkop nalotu, naa ninye ena nikiimaki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.8.4+PSA.8.5+PSA.8.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Olke 8.4-6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Eishakenoki aajo te dikae,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.2.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Netipika pooki toki abori enkitoria enye, nemeetae ae toki natelekua nemeitore ninye. Ore anaa enatiu, eton mikidol iyiook pooki toki, tiabori enkitoria enye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kake kidolita Yesu, otang'asaki aaitadou te nkiti rishata metadou abori ilmalaika, neishooki enkopiyia e nkitoo o enkanyit te nkaraki emion enye e nkeeya, peyie aa te mpiris e Enkai eishiamishama ninye enkeeya te rishata e pooki ng'ae.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.2.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu ninye apa eiririkino, olaa nkunenyena naa ninye pee eetae ntokitin pooki, ore pee etumoki ninye atorikoki inkera kumok enkitoo neiteraka emion neitaa bayarot ilo oipirua enjeunoto enye te mion o larikoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu ore ilo oitisinyi o lelo ooitisinyi nebo eing'uaa pooki. Naa ina pee mekurru ninye ejo ninche ilalashera ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
